# Theme

Every Poggy script's own screens (shops, the market, the auction house,
tickets, transform and the rest) and these menus share one look. Pick it under
**Theme**.

## The ready-made themes

| Theme | Colours |
|---|---|
| Rosewood | black and gold (the default) |
| Blackwater Steel | slate and steel blue |
| Lemoyne Moss | dark green and moss |
| Saint Denis Wine | burgundy and rose |
| Ambarino Frost | midnight and ice |
| Tumbleweed Copper | leather and copper |
| Outlaw Crimson | black and blood red |
| Silver Dollar | charcoal and silver |
